    keywords: ["Signs", "Alignment", "Meaningful coincidence", "Flow"],
    meaning: `You've been noticing things — numbers that repeat, names that keep appearing, a song that plays at exactly the right moment, a stranger who says exactly what you needed to hear. This is not coincidence. The universe does not waste its breath on random noise. Synchronicity is the language the cosmos speaks when it wants your attention, when it wants to confirm: *you are on the right path*. The question isn't whether the signs are real — they are. The question is whether you are willing to trust them over the anxious voice that says it's all just chance. Pay attention to what keeps crossing your field of vision this week. The pattern you're seeing is not your imagination. It is an invitation. Follow the breadcrumbs.`,
